    "ls_born_tough": {"comment": "the six below are what a unit may be born with: one small turn of its own on top of its group's roll, drawn as it walks in (scripts/pools/tiers.luau, LS.born). They come in pairs, one for the unit and one against it, and the numbers are small, so the group is still the group. No overlay and no icon, because a unit that stands a little apart should still look like the rest of its wave; the duration is the longest a status may run, which makes it the unit's life.",
