      ]},
    "ls_t_null_pulse": {"comment": "a sprite a block shows is never a weapon's own, for the reason a status's overlay is not: a shot's picture does the shot's damage in its own animation, and shown on its own there is no shot behind it. The EMP shockwave, the acid spore, the plague cloud, the seeker spores and the psionic shockwave all do, and two of them -- the plague cloud and the psionic shockwave -- the moment they appear, because their first animation has no ender and runs straight on into the damage. So the shows here use the thingy_ pictures instead. A weapon's name is the warning sign and not the test: the dark swarm shares its name with one and is a thingy picture, which is why Hive Mind still shows it.",
