      "scripts": {"brain": "LsBrainBruiser", "every": 1},
      "comment": "One of the seven bodies a run rolls its elites onto: a unit the game already has with more life, a look of its own in looks.json and the library spells on its card. Its name, its stats, its affixes and the spell it casts are rolled for each run (scripts/pools/tiers.luau, LS.eliteArchs), so what rides a wave is never this row as written. The generator's own kinds are made for one game (scripts/generate.luau). The ground the Ravager crosses burns: its brain lays Thermite Spray as it walks."},
